{"about_the_game":"<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >This is Fluff's Adventure!</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2989700/extras/3a9ee883e697a3c30f9bac9dc41685af.poster.avif?t=1767437926\" width=640 height=360 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2989700/extras/3a9ee883e697a3c30f9bac9dc41685af.webm?t=1767437926\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2989700/extras/3a9ee883e697a3c30f9bac9dc41685af.mp4?t=1767437926\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Discover an idyllic world through the eyes of colorful furbballs called Fluffs in this third-person puzzle platformer. <br>Explore an island full of secrets and collectibles for you to find. Learn to overcome challenges - both through dexterity while platforming in Fluff's oversized shoes and by solving numerous puzzles that will prevent you from progressing. But be warned: an evil force is invading Fluff's world and threatens to destroy the idyll forever ... </p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >What awaits you?</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Explore large-scale levels:</strong> Fluff's Adventure takes place in levels that you can explore at will. The aim is to reach the end of a level, but of course there are numerous secrets that you can find along the way. <br>  <br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2989700/extras/25f1bebdbfb3d8e171be12c7855b6822.poster.avif?t=1767437926\" width=640 height=360 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2989700/extras/25f1bebdbfb3d8e171be12c7855b6822.webm?t=1767437926\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2989700/extras/25f1bebdbfb3d8e171be12c7855b6822.mp4?t=1767437926\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span>  <br>  <br><strong>Solve color-based puzzles:</strong> Fluff's colors aren't just for show: After finding other Fluffs, you can freely switch between them to solve puzzles. Many puzzle elements in the game are colored, so you can only interact with them with a Fluff of the same color or with other objects of the same color.  <br>  <br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2989700/extras/2cefd13c5403c7fbb86d9363bbeef815.poster.avif?t=1767437926\" width=640 height=360 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2989700/extras/2cefd13c5403c7fbb86d9363bbeef815.webm?t=1767437926\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2989700/extras/2cefd13c5403c7fbb86d9363bbeef815.mp4?t=1767437926\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span>  <br>  <br><strong>Immerse yourself in a relaxed and undirected game atmosphere:</strong> Fluff's Adventure won't annoy you with explanatory text or long drawn-out tutorials: you can explore the world at your own pace and solve puzzles without being pulled out of the game environment by texts or hints. Puzzles will also never put you under time pressure: Pure relaxation (as long as you don't get frustrated by solving puzzles)!  <br>  <br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2989700/extras/a89150a49cc8e0f87587b07cc0f9694b.poster.avif?t=1767437926\" width=640 height=360 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2989700/extras/a89150a49cc8e0f87587b07cc0f9694b.webm?t=1767437926\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2989700/extras/a89150a49cc8e0f87587b07cc0f9694b.mp4?t=1767437926\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span>  <br>  <br><strong>Experience the adventures of Fluff in a gripping story</strong> Fluff's island is haunted by metallic creatures. Find out the reason for their arrival and stop them before it's too late ...</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2989700/extras/c98419ec5511f8981db9cad93c9fa7f7.poster.avif?t=1767437926\" width=640 height=360 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2989700/extras/c98419ec5511f8981db9cad93c9fa7f7.webm?t=1767437926\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2989700/extras/c98419ec5511f8981db9cad93c9fa7f7.mp4?t=1767437926\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >What is the current state of development?</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Fluff's Adventure is expected to include six levels, each with its own environment and puzzles. The first level is playable as a demo. The Early Access version currently includes single- and multiplayer modes for the first and second level. The complete game will include six levels, with puzzles themed around the following elements:</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>1. Level - Introduction:</strong> Learn the controls and mechanics of the game. Solve the first simple puzzles and find out who or what has entered the island of the Fluffs through a giant portal.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>2. Level - Light:</strong> A dark temple teaches Fluff about the history of his own island, and an unknown friend assists him in manipulating lasers and light elements.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>3. Level - Air:</strong> Fluff experiences the invasion firsthand. Escape to lofty heights and devise a plan to save the island.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>4. Level - Water:</strong> Every puzzle game needs an underwater level! Fight against currents, shift water levels to your advantage, and color Fluffs to solve tricky puzzles.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>5. Level - Fire:</strong> Learn more about the goals of the metallic invaders in the volcanic center of the island and use the dangerous element to your advantage without singeing your own fur! </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>6. Level - Space:</strong> In the epic finale, Fluff learns to influence gravity itself and must find his way in a completely unknown environment. Will all his experience and skill be enough to stop evil?</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Feel free to join my Discord server so you don't miss out on the latest developments!</p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/2989700?t=1767437926","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2989700/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1767437926","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2989700/ce9d0898c032b13c4766cd079ce1297fe7c4a7d4/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1767437926","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2989700/ce9d0898c032b13c4766cd079ce1297fe7c4a7d4/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1767437926","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Multi-player","id":1},{"description":"Co-op","id":9},{"description":"Shared/Split Screen Co-op","id":39},{"description":"Shared/Split Screen","id":24},{"description":"Full controller support","id":28},{"description":"Custom Volume Controls","id":68},{"description":"Playable without Timed Input","id":74},{"description":"Save Anytime","id":79},{"description":"Stereo Sound","id":69},{"description":"Surround Sound","id":70},{"description":"Remote Play Together","id":44},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"controller_support":"full","demos":[{"appid":3026550,"description":""}],"detailed_description":"<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >This is Fluff's Adventure!</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2989700/extras/3a9ee883e697a3c30f9bac9dc41685af.poster.avif?t=1767437926\" width=640 height=360 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2989700/extras/3a9ee883e697a3c30f9bac9dc41685af.webm?t=1767437926\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2989700/extras/3a9ee883e697a3c30f9bac9dc41685af.mp4?t=1767437926\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Discover an idyllic world through the eyes of colorful furbballs called Fluffs in this third-person puzzle platformer. <br>Explore an island full of secrets and collectibles for you to find. Learn to overcome challenges - both through dexterity while platforming in Fluff's oversized shoes and by solving numerous puzzles that will prevent you from progressing. But be warned: an evil force is invading Fluff's world and threatens to destroy the idyll forever ... </p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >What awaits you?</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Explore large-scale levels:</strong> Fluff's Adventure takes place in levels that you can explore at will. The aim is to reach the end of a level, but of course there are numerous secrets that you can find along the way. <br>  <br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2989700/extras/25f1bebdbfb3d8e171be12c7855b6822.poster.avif?t=1767437926\" width=640 height=360 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2989700/extras/25f1bebdbfb3d8e171be12c7855b6822.webm?t=1767437926\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2989700/extras/25f1bebdbfb3d8e171be12c7855b6822.mp4?t=1767437926\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span>  <br>  <br><strong>Solve color-based puzzles:</strong> Fluff's colors aren't just for show: After finding other Fluffs, you can freely switch between them to solve puzzles. Many puzzle elements in the game are colored, so you can only interact with them with a Fluff of the same color or with other objects of the same color.  <br>  <br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2989700/extras/2cefd13c5403c7fbb86d9363bbeef815.poster.avif?t=1767437926\" width=640 height=360 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2989700/extras/2cefd13c5403c7fbb86d9363bbeef815.webm?t=1767437926\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2989700/extras/2cefd13c5403c7fbb86d9363bbeef815.mp4?t=1767437926\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span>  <br>  <br><strong>Immerse yourself in a relaxed and undirected game atmosphere:</strong> Fluff's Adventure won't annoy you with explanatory text or long drawn-out tutorials: you can explore the world at your own pace and solve puzzles without being pulled out of the game environment by texts or hints. Puzzles will also never put you under time pressure: Pure relaxation (as long as you don't get frustrated by solving puzzles)!  <br>  <br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2989700/extras/a89150a49cc8e0f87587b07cc0f9694b.poster.avif?t=1767437926\