ht:</strong> A dark temple teaches Fluff about the history of his own island, and an unknown friend assists him in manipulating lasers and light elements.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>3. Level - Air:</strong> Fluff experiences the invasion firsthand. Escape to lofty heights and devise a plan to save the island.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>4. Level - Water:</strong> Every puzzle game needs an underwater level! Fight against currents, shift water levels to your advantage, and color Fluffs to solve tricky puzzles.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>5. Level - Fire:</strong> Learn more about the goals of the metallic invaders in the volcanic center of the island and use the dangerous element to your advantage without singeing your own fur! </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>6. Level - Space:</strong> In the epic finale, Fluff learns to influence gravity itself and must find his way in a completely unknown environment. Will all his experience and skill be enough to stop evil?</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Feel free to join my Discord server so you don't miss out on the latest developments!</p>","developers":["Kai Franke"],"genres":[{"description":"Adventure","id":"25"},{"description":"Casual","id":"4"},{"description":"Indie","id":"23"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2989700/de8c396c20677f1fd3f847570de113691487dad4/header.jpg?t=1767437926","is_free":false,"linux_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>","recommended":"<strong>Recommended:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>"},"mac_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>","recommended":"<strong>Recommended:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>"},"movies":[{"dash_av1":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/2989700/1110951525/08aa6f3df2dcb7a8b3593f8c7b42a38fb4b285bd/1767375385/dash_av1.mpd?t=1767376123","d